kitinerary (20.12.2-0ubuntu1) hirsute; urgency=medium

  [ José Manuel Santamaría Lema ]
  * Remove libprotobuf-dev from Build-Depends, that was a workaround and we got
    a second FTBFS. The only possible solution to fix this second FTBFS is
    rebuilding libphonenumber on top of new protobuf. The libphonenumber
    rebuild will also result in libphonenumber-dev depending on libprotobuf-dev,
    so we don't need to build depend explicitly on libprotobuf-dev.

  [ Rik Mills ]
  * New upstream release (20.12.2)

